		"name": "Food Delivery API",
		"description": "Functional verification for the Food Delivery API. Log in once and the access token is captured automatically; created resource IDs (restaurant, meal, order) are chained between requests.\n\nRecommended run order: Auth > Admin - Users > Restaurants > Meals > Coupons > Orders. Re-run the matching Login request before role-specific actions (owner for status processing/in_route/delivered, customer for received).",
